          %h2#whitehead_tower_in_general_toposes
            Whitehead tower in general
            = succeed "-toposes" do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                    %mn ∞
                    %mo ,
                    %mn 1
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} (\infty,1)
          %p
            While a notion of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Postnikov+tower+in+an+%28%E2%88%9E%2C1%29-category"} Postnikov tower in an (∞,1)-category
            depends on the
            %em categorical
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/homotopy+groups+in+an+%28%E2%88%9E%2C1%29-topos"} homotopy groups in an (∞,1)-category
            %em geometric
            homotopy groups.
          %p
            A good notion of geometric
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/homotopy+groups+in+an+%28%E2%88%9E%2C1%29-topos"} homotopy groups in an (∞,1)-topos
            exist in a
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/locally+contractible+%28%E2%88%9E%2C1%29-topos"} locally contractible (∞,1)-topos
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Whitehead+tower+in+an+%28%E2%88%9E%2C1%29-topos"}> Whitehead tower in an (∞,1)-topos
              \.
